1
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:31,220
克莱尔 卢克床上有个女孩
Claire. There's a girl in Luke's bed.

2
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:31,980
卢克在哪儿
Where's Luke?

3
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:32,940
跟女孩在一起啊
With the girl!

4
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,740
我们该制造点噪音把她吓走吗
Should we just make a noise and scare her off?

5
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,500
是女孩还是负鼠
Is it a girl or a possum?

6
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,318
亲爱的 根本没人
Honey, there's no one there.

7
00:00:42,318 --> 00:00:44,652
刚刚有的 我看到了一个女孩 还有头发
There was. I saw girl bumps and hair.

8
00:00:44,652 --> 00:00:47,140
可能只是他的丘巴卡娃娃
It was probably just his Chewbacca doll.

9
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,140
不是娃娃 那是个毛绒动作玩偶
It's not a doll. It's a plush action figure.

10
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,221
只要他还跟那玩意儿一起睡
Well, as long as he's sleeping with that thing,

11
00:00:51,221 --> 00:00:52,780
它就只会有陪睡这个动作
it's the only action he's gettin'.

12
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,300
我真是松了口气 我还没准备好他那样呢
I'm so relieved. I wasn't ready for that.

13
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,540
你以为你看到了根本不存在的东西
You thought you saw something that wasn't there.

14
00:00:57,760 --> 00:01:00,840
很黑 我们还一起喝了一整瓶酒
It's dark, and we shared an entire bottle of wine.

15
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,560
确实黑
It is dark.

16
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,500
我都没看到你说"一起"时那种开玩笑的样子
I didn't see you do air quotes around "shared".

17
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:20,240
好吧 这些合同都没问题了
All right. These contracts are good to go.

18
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:21,480
只剩下检查了
All that's left is the inspection.

19
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:22,960
已经安排好了
Already scheduled it.

20
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:25,100
安迪 如果我能把你塞进一瓶古龙水里
Andy, if I could bottle you up

21
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:27,160
然后封起来 你知道我会把你命名为什么吗
and put you into a cologne, you know what I'd call it?

22
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:27,920
进取号
"Initiative."

23
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,680
黑白广告
The black-and-white commercial

24
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,160
会让模特都变成黑豹
would have models turning into panthers.

25
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,760
进取号 来自加州的中性香水
"Initiative -- a unisex fragrance from California."

26
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,940
尽管我想继续跟你打趣
I want to come back to this because it's fun,

27
00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:37,340
但我需要你的建议
but I need your advice.

28
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:39,700
你还记得我在犹他州的堂兄吗
You remember my cousin back in Utah,

29
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,920
-那个房地产开发商 -记得啊
- the real-estate developer? - Yeah.

30
00:01:41,264 --> 00:01:43,000
他的副总要辞职
Well, turns out his V.P.'s leaving

31
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,019
去自己开公司了
to start his own company,

32
00:01:44,019 --> 00:01:46,771
然后我堂兄需要人接替他 现在就要...
and my cousin needs someone, like -- like, now.

33
00:01:47,075 --> 00:01:48,088
那是个很不错的机...
That's a big opp--

34
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:51,100
你怎么回来了
What are you doing home?

35
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:54,180
你开玩笑吗 放假了啊 我回家过暑假啊
Are you serious? School's out. I'm home for the summer.

36
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:54,880
你知道的
You knew this.

37
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:57,140
我一定是走神了 我好开心你回来了
Must have slipped my mind. I'm so glad you're back.

38
00:01:58,128 --> 00:01:58,984
就这样了吗
That's it?

39
00:02:00,032 --> 00:02:01,315
桑杰的父母给他搞了个
Sanjay's parents are throwing him

40
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:02,720
三天的"欢迎回家"派对
a three-day "Welcome Home" party.

41
00:02:02,740 --> 00:02:04,480
他们甚至用金盏花给他做了一套西服
They even made him a suit out of marigolds.

42
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,200
真是惊喜啊 小宝贝
This is a nice surprise, pumpkin.

43
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:10,780
是我在日历上
Was I too subtle with the way

44
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:12,200
写得还不明显 还是...
I put it on the calendar, or...

45
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,620
某人起床心情很好哟
Someone woke up in a good mood.

46
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,460
一个少年会这样子
And there is only one reason

47
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:20,260
只有一个原因
a teenage boy is ever like that.

48
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:22,300
是啊 因为今天是家庭露营训练日
Yep, because it's Family Camp training day!

49
00:02:22,522 --> 00:02:24,000
我本来想说
Oh, I was gonna say,

50
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,619
一定是哈林篮球队来了
"The Harlem Globetrotters must be in town."

51
00:02:25,619 --> 00:02:28,962
卢克和我正在为很重要家庭十项全能做训练
Luke and I are training for the big...Famcathlon.

52
00:02:28,962 --> 00:02:30,719
你吃得...真不少啊
You're, uh, carb-loading.

53
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,780
好主意 哥们
Good idea, buddy!

54
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:33,300
挺饿[饥渴]呀
Hungry dude.

55
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:34,720
渴望家庭露营
Hungry for Family Camp!

56
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:41,140
别马上拒绝我 快想象一下我打扮成这样
Don't say "No" right away, but picture me with these.

57
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:43,800
亲爱的 你才八岁 你的身体还需要时间成长
Sweetie, you're 8 years old. Give your body time to develop.

58
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,740
这卷发 我想要烫头发
These curls! I want a perm!

59
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:46,500
你去看看你的同龄人
Take it from someone

60
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,880
谁有烫头发的 你找不到的
who had a perm at your age -- you don't.

61
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:49,620
好了 你觉得我穿这身儿上飞机怎么样
Okay, what do you think of my airplane outfit?

62
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:51,240
我降落在密苏里的时候 我想马上融入其中
When I land in Missouri, I want to blend right in.

63
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,580
融入什么 坛罐乐队吗
With what? A jug band?

64
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:55,200
我今年夏天找到了一份工作
I got a job this summer

65
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,100
去密苏里州橄榄球队
as an assistant defensive coordinator

66
00:02:57,100 --> 00:02:58,520
当助理防守教练
for the Missouri State football team.

67
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,060
我要回家啦
Go, Bears! I'm going home.

68
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:02,540
我最近工作又非常忙 这意味着
And I have been crazy with work, which means

69
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:04,660
莉莉得在我们俩之间来回跑
Lily will be going back and forth between the two of us.

70
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,239
不过我们俩在商量
It has been a little tense

71
00:03:06,239 --> 00:03:08,000
时间安排的时候 有点小紧张
putting together a time-share agreement, though.

72
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,221
我可没有故意制造紧张
I haven't been making it tense.

73
00:03:09,221 --> 00:03:10,200
是你把我们女儿
You're the one who treats our daughter

74
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,940
当成个阿鲁巴的度假房产似的
like she's a vacation property in Aruba.

75
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:14,840
也许应该提拔你做个超强防守[爱还口的]教练
Maybe you should be promoted to very defensive coordinator.

76
00:03:15,740 --> 00:03:17,259
-给你 -你打出了
- There you go. - Okay, you typed up

77
00:03:17,259 --> 00:03:18,220
我们要怎么分享我们的女儿
how we're gonna share our daughter.

78
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:19,920
这是什么 监护协议吗
What is this -- some sort of custody agreement?

79
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:21,240
我起草了一份文件
I just drafted a document

80
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:23,100
内容大致是我们昨晚商量的东西
that reflects what we discussed last night.

81
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,740
你老是忘记你同意了的事情啊 小卡
You have a tendency to forget about things you agreed to, Cam.

82
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:27,775
那真是胡说八道
Okay, that's a bunch of hooey.

83
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:29,900
里奇 我忘记拿毛巾了 说明不了什么
Rich! I forgot to bring up the towels. That proves nothing.

84
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,420
我本不想打扰你 但我去法庭快迟到了
I wouldn't bother you, but I'm late for court.

85
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,600
非常清楚直白
It's really very straightforward.

86
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:34,380
如果密苏里连下超过三天的雨
If it rains for more than three days in Missouri,

87
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,860
我的时间就抵掉一些
that borrows against my time.

88
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:38,060
相反 如果莉莉去了体操营
Conversely, if Lily does go to gymnastics camp,

89
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,080
就要多给我一周
I get an extra week.

90
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,140
太难懂了
It's too confusing.

91
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,300
等等 你是律师 对吧
Wait -- You're a lawyer, right?

92
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:43,454
我能请你帮我看个东西吗
Can I actually have you take a peek at something for me?

93
00:03:43,454 --> 00:03:44,760
你要干什么
W-What are you doing?

94
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,760
我在请律师呢
I'm lawyering up.

95
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,580
是啊
uh, yeah.

96
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:49,620
这份合同里有太多模糊用语了
There's a lot of ambiguous language in this contract.

97
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:50,600
我要是你就不会签的
I wouldn't sign it.

98
00:03:51,140 --> 00:03:52,120
没人让他签啊
Nobody's asking him to.

99
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,740
我永远不会同意放弃国庆日那天陪莉莉的
You know, I never would have agreed to give up 4th of July,

100
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:56,380
现在我都担心
and now I'm worried

101
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:58,140
他在骗我放弃在好运饼干日那天陪莉莉的权力
he's trying to trick me out of Biscuit Bonanza.

102
00:03:58,207 --> 00:03:59,615
好运饼干日
B-Biscuit Bonanza?

103
00:03:59,615 --> 00:04:00,591
就是你听到的这样
It's what it sounds like.

104
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:02,080
是一个饼干烘焙比赛
It's a biscuit-baking competition,

105
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:03,520
比看看谁能把自己的饼干扔得最远
and then you see who can throw theirs the furthest.

106
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,700
我能展示一下证据A吗
May I present Exhibit "A"?

107
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,820
没关系 米奇尔 我才不在意国庆日
That's fine, Mitchell -- I don't care about 4th of July,

108
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,600
只要我能带莉莉参加好运饼干日
as long as I get Lily for Biscuit Bonanza.

109
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:10,720
好运饼干
Biscuit Bonanza?!

110
00:04:10,940 --> 00:04:13,200
对 就是你听到的这样 是一个饼干烘焙...
Yeah. It's what it sounds like. It's a biscuit-baking --

111
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,320
算了 我从来没这么讨厌过我的声音
Okay, I have never hated the sound of my own voice more.

112
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:16,798
好 我要去挑衣服了
Okay. I'm gonna go pick up that costume.

113
00:04:16,798 --> 00:04:18,520
什么 衣服 天呐 小卡
What costume? Oh, my God, Cam.

114
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,620
别忘了和胡娇吃早午餐
Don't forget about Pepper's brunch.

115
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:20,720
好 够了
Okay, stop it!

116
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:24,058
今天不是你第一天回去和克莱尔工作吗
Isn't it your first day back working with Claire?

117
00:04:24,058 --> 00:04:26,060
我得先把这封邮件
I got to get this e-mail out first

118
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:27,740
发到那家搞错我订单的店里去
to a store that got my order wrong.

119
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,820
我看着像那种
Do I look like a guy

120
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:30,880
会穿一件全是菠萝的衬衫的家伙吗
who would wear a shirt with pineapples all over it?

121
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:31,580
有点
Kinda.

122
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:34,600
我想全用大写字母来显示我有多么生气
I want to use all caps to get across how angry I am,

123
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:38,420
但是输入每个字目前都按一次"Shift"键实在太慢了
but it takes forever to press "Shift" before each letter.

124
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,240
你为什么直接锁定大写
Why don't you just put on the caps lock?

125
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:41,260
可以这样吗
You can do that?

126
00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:42,440
杰
Oh, Jay.

127
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:45,040
双击这里
Just double-click here.

128
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,520
不管用
Didn't work.

129
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,220
那是因为你没有双击
Well, that's because you didn't double-click.

130
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:50,300
你只是点击了两次
You just clicked twice.

131
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:51,445
有什么区别吗
The hell's the difference?

132
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,140
双击 看到没
Double-click. See?

133
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,380
我就是这样啊
That's exactly what I did.

134
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:55,420
双...击
Double...click.

135
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,180
不对 你只是点击了两次
No, you're still just clicking twice.

136
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,140
听我说 双击
Listen to me -- "Double-click."

137
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,880
不是 双...击
Not "Double...click."

138
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,000
我不是傻子
I'm not an idiot.

139
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:03,380
双击
Double-click!

140
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:05,940
这怎么可能是一样的
You can't possibly think that's the same thing!

141
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,020
那就是完全一样的
It's the exact same thing!

142
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:07,960
双击
Double-click!

143
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:08,780
双击
Double-click!

144
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,980
我...
Oh, what the...

145
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:12,120
这是我第一次说那个艹字头的字
It's the first time I've ever used the F-word.

146
00:05:12,555 --> 00:05:13,880
发生什么事了
Ay, what's going on here?

147
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,558
连我都觉得你们在尖叫
Even for me, it's a little screamy!

148
00:05:15,558 --> 00:05:17,610
我要去工作了
I'm going to work! Wh--

149
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,780
你怎么把他惹生气了
Why did you get him so mad?

150
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,180
我需要他有个好心情
I need him in a good mood.

151
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,500
我还得叫他下周跟我
I need to ask him to go with me next week

152
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:25,480
去华雷斯参加我表弟的婚礼呢
to Juárez to my cousin's wedding.

153
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,220
那里安全吗
Is that safe?

154
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,020
当然不
Of course not.

155
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:29,300
邀请函上写着 请快速跑到接待处
The invitation says "Short run to the reception".

156
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,680
万一泊车小弟因为我手短
What are the odds the valet slid the seat back

157
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,080
故意把椅子往后调怎么办
because of my weirdly short arms?

158
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:37,200
该死 我得接这个电话
Shoot. I should take this.

159
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:40,460
那钱包就给我了
Then I... should take this.

160
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:41,480
埃文
Evan.

161
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:43,780
我知道你为什么打给我
Look, I know why you're calling,

162
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:46,380
不 我没有改变主意
and no, I haven't changed my mind.

163
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,840
我不想接受这份工作
I still don't want the job.

164
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:50,880
所以你拒绝这么好的机会
So, you're turning down a chance

165
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,860
不肯回家乡接受这么棒一份工作
to move home for your dream job --

166
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:55,400
不愿开始自己的事业 就因为一个女的吗
an actual career -- all because of a girl?

167
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,240
这个叫海莉的一定很特别
This Haley must be something special.

168
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:57,800
喂
Hello?

169
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,740
信号好像断了
I think I lost you.

170
00:06:01,336 --> 00:06:02,581
喂 埃文
Hello? Evan?

171
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,020
我挂了 回头再给他打
Dropped call. I'll try him back.

172
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,240
我就知道会这样
I knew it!

173
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,120
谢谢
Thanks.

174
00:06:09,298 --> 00:06:10,640
欢迎回来 杰
Good to have you back, Jay!

175
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:11,680
回来真好 哥们儿
Good to be back, buddy.

176
00:06:12,740 --> 00:06:13,680
公司沟通小技巧
Little trick of the trade --

177
00:06:13,740 --> 00:06:15,240
当你不记得某人名字的时候 就叫他哥们儿
when you don't know somebody's name, you call 'em "Buddy".

178
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:19,780
办公室还是老样子
So, the old office, huh?

179
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:22,080
你把灯放到那边去了
I see you got the lamp over there now.

180
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,280
我这么做过一次
I tried it there once.

181
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:24,480
你会知道结果的
You'll see.

182
00:06:25,912 --> 00:06:28,160
你的办公室下午就能收拾好
Your office is gonna be ready this afternoon.

183
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,140
你要去拿新的...
Do you want to go pick up your new --

184
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,780
所以现在在忙什么 季度报告吗
So, what are we working on? Quarterly reports?

185
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:33,800
其实不是 这是人事文件
Actually, no. This is a personnel file.

186
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,443
我今天得炒了尼尔
I have to fire Neal today.

187
00:06:35,443 --> 00:06:37,076
-尼尔 -对 尼尔
- Neal? - Yeah -- Neal.

188
00:06:37,076 --> 00:06:39,620
在库房工作 喜欢加拿大那个胖乎乎的家伙
Works in the warehouse, loves Canada, heavyset fella.

189
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:40,860
你是说大哥们儿啊
Oh, you mean "Big Buddy".

190
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:43,340
他犯错造成的损失比我们靠他赚的还多
We are losing more in shipping screw-ups than he makes.

191
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,356
是时候了
It's time.

192
00:06:44,356 --> 00:06:46,340
-你现在就要去吗 -不是
- You gonna do that now? - Oh. No.

193
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:48,480
其实我现在要去复印
Um, actually, right now, I was going to make copies

194
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,980
今天下午员工会议的安排
of the agenda for this afternoon's staff meeting.

195
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,075
我来吧 你要多少份
Let me do it. How many do you need?

196
00:06:51,075 --> 00:06:52,560
12份双面打印
Uh, 12 double-sided --

197
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,480
爸 你确定要去吗
Dad, are you sure?

198
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,400
你知道复印室在哪吗
Do you even know where the copy room is?

199
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:57,000
克莱尔 拜托 这地方就是我建的
Claire. Please. I built this place.

200
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:57,860
好吧
Okay.

201
00:06:58,980 --> 00:06:59,580
另一边
Other way.

202
00:07:00,460 --> 00:07:01,720
-你好 杰 -晚点再说 哥们儿
- Hi, Jay. - Not now, buddy!

203
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:04,220
"哥们儿"策略对我爸可能有用
That "Buddy" stuff may have worked for my dad,

204
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:06,740
但我想要建立一种更私人的联系
but I wanted a more personal touch when I took over.

205
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,720
我希望大家能够开心地工作
I wanted this to be a fun place to work,

206
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:12,317
所以我在库房安了一台跳舞机
so I had an arcade dance game installed in the warehouse.

207
00:07:12,317 --> 00:07:14,620
我觉得你稍微给他们一点甜头
I figure you give them a little sugar,

208
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:17,660
能够减轻炒掉人的消极影响
takes the edge off when you have to fire someone like...

209
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:21,518
发生什么事了
What is going on?

210
00:07:21,518 --> 00:07:24,080
尼尔简直是为跳舞机而生的
Dude, Neal is tearing it up on this dance machine.

211
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:24,780
你看他的分数
Check out his score.

212
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,340
他动作相当快
He's pretty quick on that thing.

213
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,576
别担心 克莱尔
Oh, don't worry, Claire.

214
00:07:28,576 --> 00:07:29,940
他肯定不可能打破你的记录
He's never gonna beat your record.

215
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:31,520
你的记录已经保持几个月了 无人能及
You've had that for months. No one's even come close.

216
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:32,660
我一点都不担心那个
Oh, I'm not worried about that.

217
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,120
好吧 戒备心别这么强嘛
Okay. God. Don't be defensive.

218
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,299
新纪录
New high score!

219
00:07:35,299 --> 00:07:36,154
我成功了
I did it!

220
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:38,220
新纪录
New high score!

221
00:07:38,937 --> 00:07:41,200
抱歉 克莱尔
Uh, s-sorry, Claire.

222
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,580
我可不想当破了老板记录的人
Yikes. I would not want to be the guy who just beat the boss.

223
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,880
我挺喜欢这份工作的
I actually like my job.

224
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:50,980
能帮我拉一下拉链吗
Hey, can I get a zip?

225
00:07:52,411 --> 00:07:53,528
我要买这件
I'm gonna take it.

226
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,880
胡娇的派对很有趣却也令人费解
Pepper's parties are as fun as they are confusing.

227
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,680
仔细听我接下来说的
Okay, stay with me on this one.

228
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:59,920
百老汇性别错乱早午餐
Gender Blender Broadway Brunch.

229
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:02,620
你化妆成跟自己性别相反的百老汇角色
You dress as a Broadway character of the opposite sex,

230
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:04,000
而且派对不提供固体食物
and there's no solid food.

231
00:08:04,598 --> 00:08:05,700
对于下巴脱臼的
It's a perfect party

232
00:08:05,700 --> 00:08:07,020
舞会皇后来说这个派对十分完美
if you're a show queen with a broken jaw.

233
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:08,198
不好意思
Uh, excuse me.

234
00:08:08,198 --> 00:08:10,620
抱歉 普里契特先生 你的卡刷不了
Sorry, Mr. Pritchett. Your card has been declined.

235
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:11,440
不可能吧
Oh, no, that's impossible.

236
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,160
不 我试了三次了
No, I ran it, like, three times.

237
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:14,300
我貌似应该把卡剪掉
I think I'm supposed to cut it.

238
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:16,300
不要剪 我车里有现金
Oh, no, no! Don't cut it! I have some cash in the car.

239
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,600
你能帮我拉开拉链吗 好像卡住了
Can you just unzip me? I think it's stuck.

240
00:08:17,820 --> 00:08:19,140
是卡住了 你要我剪开它吗
Oh, it is stuck. You want me to cut it?

241
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,000
不要 不要剪
No, no! Don't cut it!

242
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,220
天呐 你怎么那么想剪东西
God. You really want to cut something.

243
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:22,240
我马上回来
I'll be right back.

244
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:25,820
该死
Oh, damn it!

245
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,580
不好意思 跟你合影多少钱
Excuse me. How much for a picture?

246
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,640
我其实不是...
Oh, I'm actually not --

247
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,720
拜托了 我们女儿超爱"红发安妮"
Please. Our daughter loves "Annie".

248
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:31,260
好吧
Well, uh...

249
00:08:31,773 --> 00:08:34,700
我收大概20刀吧
actually, I-I could use, like, $20.

250
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:35,895
20刀 金刚狼才收10刀
$20? Wolverine was $10.

251
00:08:35,895 --> 00:08:37,660
我不想跟你吵 我只是需要...
Look, I don't want to fight. I just -- I just need --

252
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:39,200
喂 你砸场子呢
Hey, man. What the hell?

253
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,660
不是吧
No, no, no!

254
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:45,020
想让杰按我的想法做事很不容易
It's not easy to get Jay to do what I want,

255
00:08:45,020 --> 00:08:47,320
所以有时候我得用上我的秘密武器
so sometimes I have to use my secret weapon.

256
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:49,440
不过当我懒得用秘密武器的时候
But when I'm too tired for that,

257
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:52,560
我会给他放催泪电影
I just play one of the movies that make him cry like a baby.

258
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,300
这是《追梦赤子心》吗
Is this "Rudy"?

259
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,080
我超爱这电影
Oh, I love this movie.

260
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:57,320
是吗
You do?

261
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,780
杰 我买了两张芭蕾舞的票
Jay, I got us tickets to the ballet,

262
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:04,200
可是我知道你周日要去打高尔夫
but I know that you're golfing on Sunday.

263
00:09:04,260 --> 00:09:04,840
我都听你的
Whatever you want.

264
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,980
鲁迪虽然是个小人物
You know, Rudy was small,

265
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,460
他的心胸却很宽广
but he had a big heart.

266
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,900
乔 这些卡通都是什么
Joe, what are all these cartoons?

267
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:12,193
妈咪的电影都没有了
Now all of Mommy's movies are gone!

268
00:09:12,193 --> 00:09:13,967
是曼尼做的
Manny did it.

269
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:16,040
我照顾这小家伙的时候该怎么做
What am I supposed to do when I babysit this guy?

270
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:16,860
跟他说话吗
Make conversation?

271
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,155
这孩子只会讲两个故事
The kid has two stories.

272
00:09:18,155 --> 00:09:20,008
看 我是一棵树
Look. I'm a tree.

273
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,620
这还算是比较好的故事
That's the good one.

274
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,060
妈 你为什么不回我电话
Mom, why aren't you calling me back?

275
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,540
我在你公司 我有话跟你说
I'm at your work. I need to talk.

276
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,660
不好意思 你见到克莱尔了吗
Uh, excuse me. Have you seen Claire?

277
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:28,580
有人说她在下面
Someone said she was down here.

278
00:09:28,700 --> 00:09:29,320
没有
Uh, nope.

279
00:09:31,651 --> 00:09:33,306
我炒不了尼尔
I couldn't fire Neal.

280
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:34,820
人家会觉得我炒他
It would look like I was only doing it

281
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,740
都是因为他破了我的记录
to get back at him for beating my record.

282
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,480
游戏结束
Game over!

283
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:41,980
所以我别无选择 必须先破了尼尔的记录
So I had no choice -- I had to beat Neal's score.

284
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,480
喂
Hello?

285
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:47,000
复印机要怎么用啊
How do you work a copy machine?

286
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,140
你不是吧
You can't be serious.

287
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,720
我需要双面复印12份文件
I need to make 12 double-sided copies.

288
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:52,000
这是个不可能完成的任务
It's an impossible task.

289
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,460
你就不能找个人帮忙吗
Can't you just ask someone for help?

290
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,060
我大张旗鼓地回来上班
I made a big deal out of coming back here to work.

291
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,560
得表现出自己有用
I'd like to appear useful.

292
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,980
等等 屏幕上有个感叹号
Wait -- On the screen, there's an exclamation mark.

293
00:10:00,020 --> 00:10:00,580
是不是好兆头
Is that good?

294
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:02,820
它应该不是因为当前状况而激动
I don't think it means it's excited about what's happening.

295
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,480
你有把原件放到托盘里吗
Did you put the original in the tray?

296
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,800
托盘 像上菜的托盘那种吗
Tray? You mean like a serving tray?

297
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,640
对的 杰 把纸放到上菜的托盘里
Yes, Jay. I want you to put papers in a serving tray.

298
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,220
你是怎么苟活至今的
How have you remained alive?

299
00:10:11,420 --> 00:10:12,640
我找到了
I found it!

300
00:10:15,251 --> 00:10:16,728
好 好
Yeah! Yeah!

301
00:10:16,780 --> 00:10:17,700
简直了 卡纸了
Great! It's stuck!

302
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:19,520
没关系 千万别硬拉...
That's okay. Whatever you do, don't pull the --

303
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:21,080
等等 我把纸拉出来
Hold on. I'm pulling it.

304
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:22,580
不
No!

305
00:10:25,123 --> 00:10:27,184
有了 新最高分 终于
Yes! New high score! Finally!

306
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:35,740
饿了吗
Are you hungry?

307
00:10:35,980 --> 00:10:38,540
怎么了 又是惠特尼·休斯顿诞辰吗
What's wrong? Is it Whitney Houston's birthday again?

308
00:10:38,540 --> 00:10:39,580
不是 亲爱的 我只是因为
No, honey, I'm just sad about

309
00:10:39,580 --> 00:10:40,880
要离开你那么久而伤心
being away from you for so long.

310
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,740
我们还能在一起度过六小时
We still have six hours together.

311
00:10:42,900 --> 00:10:44,580
咱们来过特别的一天吧
Let's have a special day!

312
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:45,500
肯定很有意思
Oh, that would be fun.

313
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:47,320
我们可以去骑车或者野餐
We could take a bike ride or have a picnic.

314
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:51,420
我在想更持久的东西
I was thinking something a little more permanent.

315
00:10:52,660 --> 00:10:54,600
好了 准备接橘子
Okay. Prepare to receive.

316
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:58,300
记住 关键就在靠在一起的力量
And remember, it's all about the strength of the nestle.

317
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:02,180
他脖子上有很小但清晰可见的红印
A tiny but noticeable red mark on his neck?

318
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:02,960
我不傻
I'm not an idiot.

319
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:05,160
某人一直在自己练接橘子
Someone's been practicing his orange grip.

320
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,220
跟上脚步
Pick up the pace!

321
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:07,230
我们要靠这个弥补
This is where we make up

322
00:11:07,230 --> 00:11:09,124
你妈妈在呼啦圈的劣势
for your mom being so bad at Hula-Hooping.

323
00:11:09,124 --> 00:11:09,887
走你
Shoot!

324
00:11:12,780 --> 00:11:15,680
我在卢克的窗子下偶然发现了这个
I randomly found this in a bush under Luke's window.

325
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,700
可能是艾丽克斯找海莉借来穿
Alex probably asked Haley to borrow them,

326
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:19,580
海莉扔了这双鞋
Haley threw the pair,

327
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,440
艾丽克斯接到一只
Alex caught one,

328
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,480
另一只从窗户飞了出来
the other one flew out the window,

329
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,460
电话响了 她们就忘了 女孩子啊
phone call came, they forgot. Girls.

330
00:11:28,740 --> 00:11:29,860
你在家干什么
What are you doing home?

331
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,880
接受家人一次又一次的打击
Being crushed over and over by family members.

332
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:36,500
收到你短信了
Got your message.

333
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,881
我知道你的意思可能不是"马上来"
I know you probably didn't mean "Come over right away,"

334
00:11:38,881 --> 00:11:41,280
不过你知道我挺偏执的 所以
but you know how paranoidy I can be, so...

335
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,297
去我屋里谈吧
We should talk in my room.

336
00:11:42,297 --> 00:11:44,077
好的
O...kay.

337
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:45,760
安迪 等等
Andy. Hold on a sec.

338
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,840
我知道我们刚才没谈完
I know we didn't get to finish our talk earlier,

339
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,660
因为艾丽克斯忽然出现
because of Alex's surprise pop-in.

340
00:11:53,660 --> 00:11:54,100
听着
Listen.

341
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:56,600
如果你不接受犹他州的那份工作是因为我
If you're not taking that job in Utah because of me,

342
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,760
那你就错了
you're making a mistake.

343
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,540
我喜欢咱们在一起 但如果你因为我
I love you and me together, but it would break my heart

344
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:02,340
放弃这个梦想的职位
if I was the reason

345
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:04,280
我会很伤心的
you gave up this dream career opportunity,

346
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,440
因为 说实话
because, honestly,

347
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:08,080
我不知道这里有多少未来
I don't know how much of a future there is here.

348
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:08,320
不过
But...

349
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:11,440
如果我们的联系真有我想的那么紧密
if our bond is as strong as we think it is...

350
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:14,000
我们会想办法回到对方身边的
we'll work our way back to each other.

351
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:14,580
好的
Okay.

352
00:12:18,277 --> 00:12:19,528
他说的就是我想说的
What he said.

353
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:24,781
你们聊什么呢
Hey, what's all the buzz about?

354
00:12:24,781 --> 00:12:27,760
终于有人超过尼尔无法超越的...
Somebody finally top Neal's untoppable --

355
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:28,680
怎么回事
What happened?

356
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,640
有人把跳舞机电源拔了
Someone unplugged the dance machine.

357
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,636
所以我的最高分没了
So my high score's gone?

358
00:12:31,636 --> 00:12:33,160
是尼尔的最高分吧
Don't you mean Neal's high score?

359
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:35,800
不是 我得了805分 大概20分钟前
No! I got an 805, like, 20 minutes ago!

360
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:38,297
不是吧
Oh, come on!

361
00:12:38,297 --> 00:12:40,680
你们不会认为我有那么生气
Y-You can't think that I'm really so upset

362
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,640
真的把...
that I would actually --

363
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:42,140
天呐 克莱尔
Damn, Claire.

364
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:44,460
你没必要这样阴人家吧
You didn't have to go all "Black Swan" on the guy.

365
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,780
我们难道就这么不信任她吗
Are we really not believing this woman?

366
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,320
她始终对我们很坦诚
She's never been anything but honest with us.

367
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,620
我搞砸事情的时候 她都会告诉我
When I screw up, she lets me know it,

368
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:54,860
用很体贴的方式
but in a caring way.

369
00:12:55,003 --> 00:12:57,688
对你也是 本纳德 汤姆
Same with you, Bernard...Tom.

370
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:59,280
马利 你懂的
Marie, you know it.

371
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:01,860
我们应该感谢她
It's time we started appreciating this lady.

372
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:04,000
她可能在跳舞游戏上得了800分
She may have gotten an 800 on the dance game,

373
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,060
如果你们问我的话
but if you ask me,

374
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,600
她在当老板游戏里得了1000分
she gets a 1,000 on the boss game.

375
00:13:11,675 --> 00:13:12,635
好吧
Okeydoke.

376
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,460
衣服拿了吗
Did you get the costumes?

377
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:17,420
差点拿不了 信用卡没法刷
Barely. My credit card was denied,

378
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:19,339
某人又把车里所有现金花光了
and someone spent all the cash we had in the car.

379
00:13:19,339 --> 00:13:21,580
对 都是我的错 我道歉
Uh, yeah. Those are probably both on me. I-I apologize.

380
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:23,520
咱们把我今天做的所有事抛到脑后吧
Let's maybe just forgive everything I've done today.

381
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:24,660
"所有事" 什么意思
"Everything"? What does that mean?

382
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:26,059
就是这个意思
It means this!

383
00:13:26,059 --> 00:13:27,740
我的天
Ohhh, my God!

384
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:30,180
我只是想在走之前给她一份特别的礼物
I just wanted to give her a special treat before I left.

385
00:13:30,260 --> 00:13:31,920
咱们不是说好要等她再大点吗
I thought we were gonna wait until she was older.

386
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:33,740
我是不是该把这个也写到协议里
Did I have to put that in writing, too?

387
00:13:33,820 --> 00:13:35,700
我能不能告他 我想告他
Can I sue him? I want to sue him.

388
00:13:35,820 --> 00:13:37,380
你们都有充分的理由生我气
You both have every right to be upset with me.

389
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:39,400
也许离开我几周是件好事
And maybe a few weeks away from me will do some good.

390
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,100
我打车去机场
I'm just gonna get a cab to the airport.

391
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,520
别小家子气了 我们开车送你去
Don't be crazy. We'll drive you.

392
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:44,780
不用了 我受不了在大庭广众下伤感的告别
No, I don't think I can handle a public emotional goodbye!

393
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:47,840
还记得这个可人儿吗
Remember her?

394
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:56,980
我去
Damn it!

395
00:13:58,220 --> 00:13:58,660
爸
Dad?

396
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,620
日程表在我这 克莱尔
Of course I have the agendas, Claire.

397
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:03,100
我只是想 证明一点
I was just... trying to prove a point.

398
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,981
我是说 那些日程表有什么用
I mean, what do you need those things for, anyway?

399
00:14:04,981 --> 00:14:07,480
日程表 就像拐棍 弱者才用
Agendas -- they're crutches. They're for the weak.

400
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:10,236
你以为开国元老会用这种东西吗
You think the founding fathers wrote down an agenda?

401
00:14:10,236 --> 00:14:11,460
说的不就是独立宣...
Well, isn't the Declaration of Inde--

402
00:14:11,460 --> 00:14:13,500
领导人就该领导 不是读稿
A leader leads, not reads.

403
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:15,620
拿着一叠日程表去开会
You go into that meeting with a bunch of agendas,

404
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:16,940
就是在寻求他们的认同
you're asking for their approval.

405
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:17,820
喜欢我吧 喜欢我吧 喜欢我吧
"Like me! Like me! Like me!"

406
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:19,100
我就不喜欢
I say "No"!

407
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,460
我跟你说过多少次
How many times have I told you --

408
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:22,260
当好老板的第一条规则就是
the first rule of being a good boss is

409
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:23,760
不要让员工成为你的朋友
"You don't need your employees to be your friends."

410
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,040
要让他们尊重你
You need them to respect you!

411
00:14:26,400 --> 00:14:27,700
谢谢
Thank you.

412
00:14:27,780 --> 00:14:30,420
我需要听的正是这些话
That is...exactly what I needed to hear.

413
00:14:30,468 --> 00:14:31,660
-分内之事而已 -对
- I'm just doing my job. - Yeah.

414
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,740
相信自己 孩子
Just trust your gut, kid.

415
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:35,160
双击
Double-click...

416
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:36,820
自己
on...yourself.

417
00:14:41,230 --> 00:14:42,560
什么这么香
What smells so good?

418
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,500
为我自己的"欢迎回家"大餐
I'm making my favorite lasagna

419
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:46,000
做我最喜欢的意大利千层面
for my own "Welcome Home" dinner.

420
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:47,218
能不能问你个事
Can I ask you a question?

421
00:14:47,218 --> 00:14:48,760
-什么事 -你觉得你弟
- What? - Do you think it's possible

422
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:50,820
有没有可能在昨晚偷偷带女孩子回家
that your brother snuck a girl in here last night?

423
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,202
我不会那么惊讶
I wouldn't be too surprised.

424
00:14:52,202 --> 00:14:53,900
所以你觉得他 他们已经
So you think he's -- t-that they've been --

425
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:56,960
得了吧 爸 别那么天真
Oh, come on, Dad. Don't be so naive.

426
00:14:57,580 --> 00:14:58,880
谁都有过十七年华
We were all 17 once.

427
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:02,000
说得好像谁还是...
It's not like we all --

428
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,500
我在那坐了有20分钟
I sat there like that for 20 minutes.

429
00:15:14,295 --> 00:15:16,610
然后又听到了更可怕的消息
And then I got some more awful news.

430
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,751
我刚收到邮件说家庭露营活动取消了
I just got an e-mail saying Family Camp was canceled --

431
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:20,720
报名人数不够
not enough sign-ups.

432
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:22,220
就这样吗
That's it?

433
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,780
你一点都不关心 是不是
You don't care at all, do you?

434
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:27,140
忙着跟昨晚那个姑娘缠缠绵绵
You're too busy running around with that girl from last night!

435
00:15:27,620 --> 00:15:29,820
对 没错 我什么都知道
Yeah! That's right! I know everything!

436
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:31,640
你怎么能这样呢 卢克
How could you, Luke?

437
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:33,840
其实我不知道自己为什么这么生气
To be honest, I don't know why I was so upset.

438
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,880
我知道我是该生气
I knew I was supposed to be mad,

439
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,200
但我说不出具体原因
but I couldn't figure out why,

440
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,360
所以我只能照套路先说他几句
so I just started saying a bunch of stuff.

441
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:40,340
就在我家
Under my roof?!

442
00:15:40,560 --> 00:15:41,320
这句好诡异
That was weird.

443
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,360
在我付钱买的床上
In a bed that I paid for?!

444
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:44,660
说这话意义何在
What does that have to do with anything?

445
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:46,160
就在你爷爷的眼皮底下
With your grandfather watching?!

446
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:46,760
意义何在
What?

447
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,920
但这都远不够我真正想说的那么夸张
But it wasn't half as crazy as what I really wanted to yell,

448
00:15:49,940 --> 00:15:52,300
那就是 "别再长大了"
which was "Just stop growing up!"

449
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:55,320
听着 我不保证我现在说的全部有道理
Look, I'm not sure everything I said here makes sense,

450
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:58,680
但是你真得谨慎点 有点敬畏心
but...just be careful and respectful.

451
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,660
而且你的确犯了一个大错
And you did break a big rule,

452
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:03,080
罚你一个月不准用家里的车
so no car privileges for a month.

453
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,420
我也用不着车了
I don't need it anyway.

454
00:16:05,780 --> 00:16:06,900
我被人甩了
I just got dumped.

455
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:17,300
我们就那样在那里坐了20分钟
We sat there like that for 20 minutes.

456
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:20,220
第一天上班怎么样
How was your first day at work?

457
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:21,120
有点小困难
It was a little rough,

458
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,800
但我好像也惹了点麻烦
but I kind of stumbled into something.

459
00:16:23,300 --> 00:16:24,920
妈咪你不是要问他吗
Aren't you going to ask him, Mommy?

460
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,200
他在说什么
What's he talking about?

461
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:26,776
没什么
Nothing.

462
00:16:26,776 --> 00:16:29,760
我本来想叫你下礼拜陪我去华雷斯
I was going to ask you to go to Juárez with me

463
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:31,400
参加我表亲婚礼的
next week for my cousin's wedding,

464
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:33,900
但我知道你肯定不愿意 所以我自己去
but I know that you don't want to go, so I'll go alone.

465
00:16:36,112 --> 00:16:37,620
你真的不去吗
You're really not gonna go?

466
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:39,620
你也听见她说了 她自己去没事
Well, you heard her. She's fine going alone.

467
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:43,180
如果飞机落地的时候是她一个人出舱
If that plane leaves the ground and you're not with her,

468
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:44,120
你一定会后悔的
you'll regret it.

469
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:46,840
也许今天明天你没有感觉
Maybe not today and maybe not tomorrow,

470
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:49,300
但很快你就会后悔 而且会后悔一辈子
but soon, and for the rest of your life.

471
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:51,180
你在说什么 《卡萨布兰卡》的台词吗
What did you say? Is that "Casablanca"?

472
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:53,280
"不难看清 在这纷纷乱世"
"It doesn't take much to see"

473
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:55,419
"三个小人物的问题"
"the problems of three little people"

474
00:16:55,419 --> 00:16:59,019
"其实无足轻重"
"don't amount to a hill of beans in this crazy world."

475
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,460
"总有一天你会明白的"
"Someday, you'll understand that."

476
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:01,701
"好了 没事了"
"Now, now."

477
00:17:01,701 --> 00:17:03,662
"没事的 孩子"
Here's looking at you, kid.

478
00:17:05,084 --> 00:17:06,780
歌洛莉亚 关于那场婚礼
Gloria! About that wedding --

479
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:09,020
我已经在订机票了
I'm already booking the ticket!

480
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:11,680
好 它长出来了
Okay, it's growing!

481
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:13,400
我在跟信用卡公司打电话
I'm on hold with the credit-card company.

482
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,440
我们要不找找看今晚吃什么
We should probably try and figure out dinner.

483
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,940
我连冰箱里有什么都不知--
I have no idea what we even have in the --

484
00:17:17,940 --> 00:17:18,960
天呐 莉莉你看
Oh, my God. Lily, look.

485
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:20,980
大爸给我们做了这么多吃的
Daddy made us all this food.

486
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:23,820
"加热20分钟 余生都要爱我"
"Heat for 20 minutes. Love me for the rest of time."

487
00:17:24,131 --> 00:17:26,300
旭日东升塔马利[墨西哥玉米粉蒸肉]
"The sun will come out tamales."

488
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:27,200
天呐
Oh, my God.

489
00:17:27,360 --> 00:17:28,920
你觉得他是不是在忙着做饭
You think he forgot about my curlers

490
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,294
所以忘了帮我摘掉卷发夹
because he was too busy cooking?

491
00:17:30,294 --> 00:17:31,360
可能是吧 我不知--
Maybe. I don't kn--

492
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,360
是的 你好
Oh, yes. Hello?

493
00:17:33,853 --> 00:17:35,910
好-- 好的 谢谢
Oka-- Okay. Well, thank you.

494
00:17:36,140 --> 00:17:37,240
大爸买了一张机票
Um, Daddy bought a plane ticket

495
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,020
准备在国庆日给我们一个惊喜
to surprise us on the 4th of July.

496
00:17:39,380 --> 00:17:40,900
所以我的信用卡才透支了
That's why my credit card was over the limit.

497
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:43,140
我好后悔当时冲着他那样喊
Now I feel bad for yelling at him.

498
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,220
是 我也后悔了
Yeah, me too.

499
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:47,420
那么 到这儿就该结束了[队尾]
So, this is the end of the line.

500
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:49,020
不 不是 我跟你说过的
No. No! I told you!

501
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:50,820
你会来看我 我也会去看--
You're gonna come visit, I'll come there --

502
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:52,540
不是 我说的是安检队伍
No. I meant security.

503
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:55,900
那我们... 不来那些煽情的套路了
So... none of that messy stuff,

504
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:58,601
又不是要永别
because this is not goodbye goodbye.

505
00:17:58,601 --> 00:18:01,367
对 离别不舍的戏还是留给那边二位吧
Yeah. We'll leave the drama to those two.

506
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,320
"亲爱的 答应我永远不要忘记我"
"Promise me you won't forget me, my darling."

507
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:08,200
"我会的 除非这老土套装重领时尚"
"I'll love you until this pantsuit comes back in style."

508
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:10,980
"我不后悔与你度过的每分每秒"
"I don't regret a single minute I've spent with you."

509
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,540
"我觉得你是我真心爱过的第一个男人"
"I think you're the first man I've ever loved."

510
00:18:15,060 --> 00:18:16,660
每分每秒 从不后悔
Not a single minute.

511
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:19,100
你真的是第一个
You really are the first.

512
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:41,744
在我成长的过程中 有猪和牛的陪伴
Now, I had pigs and cows when I was growing up --

513
00:18:41,744 --> 00:18:42,511
小卡
Cam!

514
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,320
噢我的天 你们来这儿干什么
Oh, my gosh! What are you guys doing here?

515
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:46,160
我们俩反思了一整天
We spent the whole day thinking about ourselves,

516
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:46,817
然后意识到...
and then realized...

517
00:18:46,817 --> 00:18:49,220
你一整天也都在关心呵护着我们
you've spent the whole day thinking about us, too.

518
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:51,260
所以我拿了点东西给你带回密苏里
So I brought you something to take to Missouri.

519
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,560
我要和你一起回去 大爸
I'm coming with you, Daddy!

520
00:18:52,780 --> 00:18:54,798
我的天呐 我能整个夏天都和她在一起
Oh, my gosh! I get to keep her for the whole summer?

521
00:18:54,798 --> 00:18:56,020
-是的 -但你不会想念她吗
- Yeah! - But won't you miss her?

522
00:18:56,020 --> 00:18:56,820
不 不会
No. No.

523
00:18:56,820 --> 00:18:58,360
因为我也要跟你们一起去
Because I'm coming, too!

524
00:18:59,256 --> 00:19:01,002
我的老-- 那你的工作怎么办
My good-- well, what about work?

525
00:19:01,002 --> 00:19:02,340
其实我在密苏里也能完成工作
Well, I figure I could work from there,

526
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:03,783
然后时不时也能飞回来处理事务
and, you know, fly back when I need to.

527
00:19:03,783 --> 00:19:05,872
避暑纳凉时能被新鲜饼干香气围绕挺好的
Think I could use a summer of smelling fresh biscuits --

528
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:07,640
还有 显然也能扔饼干
and, apparently, throwing them.

529
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:09,980
看看这是谁觉得自己第一年就有资格参赛
Well, look who thinks he's gonna qualify his first year.

530
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,540
我们要回去做密苏里人了
We're gonna be Missourians!

531
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:17,760
有时候你会经历
Sometimes, you have one of those days

532
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:19,640
被众人围绕着
where you are surrounded by people

533
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,820
却仍然觉得十分孤独的时刻
but you still feel pretty lonely.

534
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:28,900
你只想回到家人身边汲取安慰
All you want to do is go home to the comfort of your family.

535
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:37,840
但有时即使是家人都无法给你这种安慰
But sometimes, even your family can't give you that comfort.

536
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:43,760
因为其实他们也会遭遇和你一样的孤独
Because it turns out they've all had one of those days, too.

537
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:47,340
你只能隐忍地等到这种煎熬结束
All you can do is wait for days like that to be over...

538
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,580
然后你就能好好睡下
so you can go to bed

539
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:52,280
希望醒来后是美好的一天
and hope you wake up to a better tomorrow.

540
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:54,840
菲尔
Phil.

541
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,720
菲尔 我好像听到卢克房里有声响
Phil, I think I hear something in Luke's room.

542
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,400
又来
Again?

543
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:03,200
怎么了
What?

544
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,980
我们知道你有多喜欢家庭露营训练日
We know how much you love Family Camp.

545
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:06,220
但是它被取消了
But it was canceled,

546
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:07,680
我也觉得你们都早就对它无爱了
and I thought you were all kind of over it.

547
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,760
我们可能对它无爱 但是我们爱着彼此
We may be over it, but we're not over us.

548
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,280
你觉得要不要办个升级版家庭露营训练日
What do you think about Family Camp 2.0?

549
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:15,421
对啊 菲尔 赶紧的 车马上就要到了
Yeah, Phil, come on. Cab's gonna be here any minute.

550
00:20:15,421 --> 00:20:16,440
你不用收拾点行李吗
Don't you have some packing to do?

551
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:17,880
为什么我们老是要等你
Why are we always waiting on you?

552
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:20,080
我不知道我收拾完行李要去哪儿
I don't know where I'm packing for,

553
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:21,020
但是我太高兴了
but I love this!

554
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:24,800
真棒 这些看上去多美味啊
All right. How good do these look?

555
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:26,720
所以它们获评"纽约最佳美食"
That's why they call them "New York's Finest."

556
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:28,380
就是 有美食的陪伴
Yeah, who needs a campfire

557
00:20:28,380 --> 00:20:30,260
没有篝火露营又如何
when we've got a metal box full of gray water?

558
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:32,020
好了各位 合个影
Okay, everybody, picture.

559
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:33,723
女士 能帮我们照张相吗
Uh, ma'am? Would you mind?

560
00:20:34,321 --> 00:20:36,460
站到后面去 你这么高 行了行了
get in the back. Get in the back. You're tall. Okay. Okay.

561
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,720
好了 说茄...
All right. And...

562
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:40,840
现在又少一部手机了
And now we're down to three phones.

563
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,120
老板 是老爸
Hey, boss. It's Dad.

564
00:20:45,380 --> 00:20:46,760
我知道我才刚回来上班
I know I just started back,

565
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:49,179
但是如果可以 我要请几天假
but I'm taking a couple of days off, if that's okay.

566
00:20:49,179 --> 00:20:52,020
如果不可以也没办法 我在华雷斯
And if not, too bad. I'm in Juárez!

567
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:53,036
老爸 我是米奇
Hey, Dad. It's Mitch.

568
00:20:53,036 --> 00:20:54,769
那个 我现在和小卡在密苏里
Uh, I'm in Missouri with Cam.

569
00:20:54,769 --> 00:20:57,020
不 我不是被他绑过来的
No, it's not a hostage situation.

570
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:59,240
您能不能顺路到我们家帮忙浇浇花草
Anyway, uh, can you swing by our place and water our plants?

571
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:01,020
还有 别忘了卧室里的那盆无花果
Oh, and don't forget about the ficus in the bedroom.

572
00:21:01,020 --> 00:21:02,688
我知道你有多爱到我们卧室里去
I know how much you love to go in there.

573
00:21:02,769 --> 00:21:05,580
我是你姐姐 花姑娘
Hey! It's your big sis, ya big sis.

574
00:21:05,580 --> 00:21:07,100
是这样 我们一家今早飞来纽约了
So, we all flew to New York this morning.

575
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:09,440
幸好老爸回公司上班 正好替我打掩护
Thank God Dad came back to work. He can cover for me.

576
00:21:09,780 --> 00:21:11,760
无所谓了 对了 我好像没锁后门
Anyway. Listen, I think I left the back door unlocked.

577
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,480
你能帮忙看一下吗
Can you check?

578
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:14,980
来纽约吧 这里的椒盐脆饼巨大无比
Come to New York! The pretzels are huge!
